sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as CLI / Admin
    participant API as POST /api/imports/submit
    participant W as import_worker (单消费者)
    participant PF as _process_file (threadpool)
    participant EMB as embed (threadpool)
    participant LK as store_lock
    participant DB as vector_db.insert + flush
    participant POLL as GET /api/imports/jobs/{id}

    Admin->>API: POST /api/imports/submit {type, source?, params?}
    API->>W: submit(type, source, params, user) 入队
    W-->>API: {job_id, status: queued}
    API-->>Admin: {job_id}
    W->>W: _consume 循环 queue.get(job_id)
    W->>PF: _process_file(fp) via run_in_executor
    PF->>PF: parse + chunk (import_pdfs / import_docling)
    PF->>EMB: embed(texts) via run_in_executor (E5 编码)
    EMB-->>PF: embeddings[]
    PF->>LK: async with store_lock
    LK->>DB: vector_db.insert + flush (单写者不变式)
    LK-->>PF: 完成
    PF-->>W: inserted_chunks
    W->>W: 检查 cancel_requested，处理下一文件
    Admin->>POLL: GET /api/imports/jobs/{id}
    POLL-->>Admin: {status, progress{...}}
    Note over Admin,POLL: 轮询至 terminal: succeeded / failed / cancelled / interrupted
